[b]Hi Mutant Football League Steam Community![/b]

As you know, MFL is a community driven product, the MFL community helps drive what features & teams they want to see in the game next. From the beginning of 2019, we have been gathering your feedback & planning our next moves. This summer we'll be working to deliver multiple changes, new content for the game along with some other surprises.

Previously, we promised to reveal our plans & the time has come to share a short list of what is coming soon:[list]
   [*]New Teams: the top 2 teams from our recent survey as DLC (to be revealed soon); 
   [*]Bug-fixes; 
   [*]Roster Updates to reflect the 2019 season; 
   [*]New Achievements; 
   [*]More Options to customize game modes & matches; 
   [*]Improvement/polish of the existing gameplay mechanics;
[/list]
We’ll have a few other surprises for everyone as we get closer to our update release!

As usual, thank you all for attention, support, & feedback!


[b]Best wishes,
The MFL Team[/b]

